    "title": "SentinelX Operations Runbook",
    "description": "1. Verify Backend Health: Check https://<api-domain>/health.",
    "content": "# SentinelX Operations Runbook\n\n## 1. Daily Operations Checklist\n\n1. **Verify Backend Health**: Check `https://<api-domain>/health`.\n2. **Review Open Incidents**: Triage new incidents on the SOC Dashboard.\n3. **Execute AI Threat Analysis**: Run OpenRouter analysis on untriaged critical incidents.\n4. **Deploy Containment Actions**: Stage and mark response actions completed for verified threats.\n5. **Generate Daily PDF Reports**: Download executive incident reports for management sign-off.\n"
